    "en": {
      "trackName": "Blackjack Flash",
      "description": "Step into the excitement of Las Vegas Blackjack — now on both iPhone and Apple Watch! Blackjack Flash delivers an authentic, high-speed casino experience wherever you are: full-screen on your iPhone or right from your wrist.\n\nWhether you're on a break, commuting, or simply craving a quick adrenaline rush, Blackjack Flash makes every moment feel like you're seated at a Vegas table.\n\nVEGAS CASINO IN YOUR POCKET AND ON YOUR WRIST\n\n• Authentic Blackjack Rules: Hit, Stand, Double Down, Split, and Insurance.\n• Instant Gameplay: Lightning-fast rounds perfect for quick sessions.\n• Customizable Premium Visuals: Choose your table themes, card backs, card faces, and animations.\n• Designed for iPhone and Apple Watch: Native controls on both — tap and swipe your way to 21.\n• iCloud Sync: Your stats, achievements, and shop unlocks follow you across your devices.\n\nNEW: GAME CENTER\n\n• 65 Achievements: From your first hand to legendary feats like Lucky Sevens.\n• Leaderboards: Compete globally for Most Wins, Best Win Streak, and Total Blackjacks.\n\nFLASH FEATURES FOR FAST FUN\n\n• Tap-to-Play: Start playing in seconds\n• Coins: Earn coins to spend in an in-game shop to customize your experience\n• Multi-Language Support\n\nWHO LOVES BLACKJACK FLASH?\n\n• iPhone and Apple Watch players\n• Card game lovers\n• Busy professionals seeking quick entertainment\n• Casual Blackjack players\n• Players who appreciate premium quality and intuitive design\n• Anyone craving Blackjack thrills, anytime, anywhere\n\nUNLOCK THE FULL VEGAS EXPERIENCE (Premium Upgrade)\n\n• Unlimited Hands\n• Achievement Coin Rewards: Earn coins from all 65 achievements.\n• Full Shop Access: Use your coins to personalize your game experience completely.\n• Advanced Stats: Dive deep into detailed statistics tracking wins, losses, and more!",
      "releaseNotes": "Game Center is now fully live — climb the 3 global leaderboards and start unlocking all 65 achievements!",
